OL,3,AHuang agrees to appear before Congress,
OL,4,AUS lawmakers say, after scandal-hit
OL,5,ANvidia CEO resigns
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang has resigned as CEO of
OL,8,Ftech giant Nvidia, the company's board
OL,9,Fsays, with chief financial officer
OL,10,FColette Kress appointed interim boss
OL,12,FUS lawmakers on Capitol Hill say Huang
OL,13,Fhas indicated he is willing to appear
OL,14,Fbefore Congress for questioning,
OL,15,Faccording to the BBC's US media partner
OL,16,FCBS News
OL,18,FThe company's shares were down about 4%
OL,19,Fwhen US markets closed on Thursday,
OL,20,Fhaving recovered some ground after
OL,21,Fplummeting more than 13% after news of
OL,22,Fhis resignation
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
