OL,3,AHuang agrees to appear before Congress,
OL,4,AUS lawmakers say, after scandal-hit
OL,5,ANvidia CEO resigns
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Sunday, Huang admitted an affair
OL,8,Fwith a woman, who was reportedly from
OL,9,Fanother company and suspected to be a
OL,10,FChinese spy
OL,12,FThe New York Times has since reported
OL,13,Fthat Huang had a second affair with an
OL,14,Fexecutive at his own company
OL,16,FMeanwhile, Beijing has called
OL,17,Fallegations of spying a "smear" and
OL,18,Fwarned the US not to use the spying
OL,19,Fallegations as a pretext to once again
OL,20,Frestrict tech sales to China
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
